      "text": {
        "jp": "リドの相棒「メカボ」は、多彩な技を覚えていきます。\r\n\r\nメカボに新しい技を覚えさせるには\r\nヴェルンと協力して、メカボを改造する必要があります。\r\n\r\n改造には、魔物が落とす素材が必要になります。\r\nヴェルンから、どんな素材が必要か、聞いてみましょう。",
        "official_en": "Lid’s partner, Mechabo, can be upgraded to learn a\r\nwide variety of skills.\r\n\r\nTo do so, you’ll need to gather materials from monsters\r\nand deliver them to Verun.\r\n\r\nTalk to Verun to see what materials are needed.",
        "real_en": "Lid’s partner Mechabo can learn a wide variety of skills.\r\n\r\nTo teach Mechabo new skills, you’ll need to work with Verun to upgrade him. Upgrades require materials dropped by monsters.\r\n\r\nAsk Verun which materials you need."
      },
